[161.952569, "o", "\u001b[m\u000fNorth of House\r\u001b[38d"]
[161.953052, "o", "You are facing the north side of a white house. There is no door here, and all the windows are boarded up. To the north a narrow path winds through the trees.\r\u001b[40d"]
