[187.943786, "o", "\u001b[0;7m\u000f2\r\u001b[36d\u001b[m\u000fLiving Room\r\u001b[37dYou are in the living room. There is a doorway to the east, a wooden door with strange gothic lettering to the west, which appears to be nailed shut, a trophy\r\u001b[38dcase, and a large oriental rug in the center of the room.\r\u001b[40d>"]
[195.662762, "i", "move rug\n"]
