[195.919096, "o", "\u001b[0;7m\u000f4\r\u001b[38d\u001b[m\u000fThe door reluctantly opens to reveal a rickety staircase descending into darkness.\r\u001b[40d>"]
[196.114865, "i", "down\n"]
[196.115142, "o", "down"]
[196.115432, "o", "\r\u001b[2d\u001b[8M\u001bM\u001b[C\u001b[0;7m\u000fCellar     \u001b[1;138H35\u001b[155G"]
[196.115485, "o", "5\r\u001b[33d\u001b[m\u000fThe trap door crashes shut, and you hear someone barring it.\r\u001b[35dCellar\r\u001b[36dYou are in a dark and damp cellar with a narrow passageway leading north, and a crawlway to the south. On the west is the bottom of a steep metal ramp which is\r\u001b[37dunclimbable.\r\u001b[38dYour sword is glowing with a faint blue glow.\r\u001b[40d>"]
[196.305448, "i", "look\n"]
[196.305708, "o", "lo"]
[196.305851, "o", "ok"]
[196.306029, "o", "\r\u001b[2d"]
[196.306165, "m", "Episode 7: 2 commands"]
[196.306165, "o", "\u001b[5M\u001bM\u001b[155G\u001b[0;7m\u000f6\r\u001b[36d\u001b[m\u000fCellar\r\u001b[37dYou are in a dark and damp cellar with a narrow passageway leading north, and a crawlway to the south. On the west is the bottom of a steep metal ramp which is\r\u001b[38dunclimbable.\r\u001b[40d>"]
[208.543823, "i", "north\n"]
[208.54418, "o", "north"]
[208.544716, "o", "\r\u001b[2d"]
[208.5449, "o", "\u001b[7M\u001bM\u001b[C"]
[208.545061, "o", "\u001b[0;7m\u000fThe Troll Room\u001b[155G"]
[208.545212, "o", "7\r\u001b[34d"]
[208.545309, "o", "\u001b[m\u000fThe Troll Room\r\u001b[35d"]
[208.545509, "o", "This is a small room with passages to the east and south and a forbidding hole leading west. Bloodstains and deep scratches (perhaps made by an axe) mar the\r\u001b[36d"]
[208.545839, "o", "walls.\r\u001b[37d"]
[208.54708, "o", "A nasty-looking troll, brandishing a bloody axe, blocks all passages out of the room.\r\u001b[38dYour sword has begun to glow very brightly.\r\u001b[40d>"]
[208.786868, "i", "look\n"]
[208.78829, "m", "Episode 8: 2 commands"]
[208.78829, "o", "look\r\u001b[2d\u001b[6M\u001bM\u001b[155G\u001b[0;7m\u000f8\r\u001b[35d\u001b[m\u000fThe Troll Room\r\u001b[36dThis is a small room with passages to the east and south and a forbidding hole leading west. Bloodstains and deep scratches (perhaps made by an axe) mar the\r\u001b[37dwalls.\r\u001b[38dA nasty-looking troll, brandishing a bloody axe, blocks all passages out of the room.\r\u001b[40d>"]
[216.797959, "i", "kill troll\n"]
