[1493.143225, "m", "Episode 42: 3 commands"]
[1493.143225, "o", "\u001b[0;7m\u000f7\r\u001b[36d\u001b[m\u000fCellar\r\u001b[37dYou are in a dark and damp cellar with a narrow passageway leading north, and a crawlway to the south. On the west is the bottom of a steep metal ramp which is\r\u001b[38dunclimbable.\r\u001b[40d>"]
[1570.933722, "i", "quit\n"]
[1570.934964, "o", "quit\r\u001b[2d\u001b[3M\u001b[38dYour score is 49 (total of 350 points), in 117 moves.\r\u001b[39dThis gives you the rank of Amateur Adventurer.\r\u001b[40dDo you wish to leave the game? (Y is affirmative): >"]
